@startuml listing_state_uml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

title Life of a listing

[*] --> Available : seller creates the listing

Available --> Available : seller edits it\n(an actual change rejects pending offers)
Available --> Reserved : seller accepts an offer\n(other pending offers rejected)
Reserved --> Available : sale cancelled
Reserved --> Sold : sale completed
Available --> Archived : seller archives it\n(pending offers rejected)
Sold --> Archived : seller archives it

Available --> [*] : seller deletes it\n(no offer history only)
Archived --> [*] : seller deletes it\n(no offer history only)

note right of Reserved
  Cannot be edited, archived, or
  deleted while its sale is active.
end note
note bottom of Archived
  Archiving is final. Deleting also deletes
  the listing's enquiry conversations.
end note
@enduml
